WEBVTT

00:05.150 --> 00:07.900
I'll grant any one of your wishes!

00:08.150 --> 00:10.140
But before that, tell me your name!

00:10.140 --> 00:12.530
M-My name is Cliff Grimor.

00:12.530 --> 00:13.810
Cliff, eh?

00:13.810 --> 00:17.290
Feeding me was a big achievement,
you know.

00:17.540 --> 00:21.400
After all, I haven't eaten
in the past six months.

00:21.400 --> 00:23.920
It's been a while, Lady Kishirika.

00:23.920 --> 00:25.780
And who are you?

00:30.090 --> 00:31.690
Wait, it's you!

00:31.690 --> 00:35.190
The man who has disgusting mana,
even though you're a human

00:35.190 --> 00:39.980
I think your name was Roo...
Roomba?

00:39.980 --> 00:41.440
Roombaus!

00:41.730 --> 00:44.010
I'm not a vacuum cleaner.

00:44.570 --> 00:46.280
It's Rudeus Greyrat.

00:46.280 --> 00:48.530
Yes, yes, I remember now.

00:48.530 --> 00:51.360
However, this time the reward
is not for you.

00:51.360 --> 00:53.490
Now, Cliff Grimor!

00:53.490 --> 00:56.910
Name your desire!

00:58.240 --> 01:02.330
In that case, please tell me
how to cure Dryne Syndrome.

01:04.269 --> 01:07.000
An acquaintance of mine is suffering
from that disease right now.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.300
If you know anything about it,
please tell me.

01:09.300 --> 01:12.300
I see. Dryne Syndrome...

01:12.300 --> 01:17.140
I'm surprised someone still gets
that disease in this day and age.

01:18.440 --> 01:20.240
Can it be cured?

01:20.240 --> 01:22.360
Of course it can!

01:23.520 --> 01:27.700
All you have to do is
drink tea of Sokas Grass,

01:27.700 --> 01:29.650
and flush it out along
with your poop.

01:29.870 --> 01:32.740
Sokas Grass?
Where can we find it?

01:32.740 --> 01:36.910
Inside a cave in the canyon
known as Red Wyrm's Tail.

01:37.229 --> 01:39.820
But, at the end of the second
Great Human-Demon War,

01:39.820 --> 01:42.100
the battle between
Dragon God and Fighting God

01:42.100 --> 01:44.729
caused a hole in the continent,

01:44.729 --> 01:46.420
wiping out that place in the process.

01:47.750 --> 01:51.590
Does that mean Sokas Grass
no longer exists?

01:52.360 --> 01:54.090
Therefore...

01:54.090 --> 01:59.720
I ordered every demon king to cultivate
this grass beneath their castle!

01:59.720 --> 02:02.660
After all, Sokas Grass tea
is very delicious!

02:05.480 --> 02:07.810
Did you think you wouldn't
be able to get it?

02:07.810 --> 02:09.370
I bet you did, didn't you?

02:09.370 --> 02:11.110
Sorry for being a bummer.

02:11.110 --> 02:14.480
But they're growing right there
in Kishirika Castle!

02:14.480 --> 02:17.070
Shall I kick this brat?

02:17.070 --> 02:18.450
This brat...!

02:18.450 --> 02:20.370
Please wait, Senior Cliff.

02:20.370 --> 02:22.670
Let her spill everything first.

02:22.670 --> 02:24.290
Y-Yeah...

02:24.850 --> 02:30.890
Then, Lady Kishirika, could you share
some of Sokas Grass with us?

02:30.890 --> 02:32.260
Sure!

02:32.540 --> 02:35.070
But there's just one problem.

02:35.070 --> 02:39.040
Now, there's a terrible individual
staying in Kishirika Castle.

02:53.890 --> 02:55.150
Halt!

02:55.440 --> 02:58.270
We're the personal guard of the
Immortal Demon King, Atoferatofe,

02:58.270 --> 03:01.540
who rules over the Gaslow Territory.

03:01.840 --> 03:05.550
Would you kindly hand over
Lady Kishirika to us?

03:05.550 --> 03:07.290
And if we say no?

03:09.100 --> 03:11.460
I heard what you were talking about.

03:12.860 --> 03:16.470
We also know how to cultivate
the Sokas Grass.

03:17.640 --> 03:21.130
If you desire,
we can give you a potted one.

03:21.130 --> 03:22.720
So please.

03:23.810 --> 03:26.730
D-Don't trust his words!

03:26.730 --> 03:30.090
Atofe is the stupidest demon king!

03:30.090 --> 03:32.270
She isn't the kind of person
you can have a conversation with!

03:33.860 --> 03:36.030
What's going on here exactly?

03:36.030 --> 03:39.140
When Lady Atofe went
to get a special booze,

03:39.140 --> 03:42.329
Lady Kishirika drank
the entire bottle of it.

03:42.329 --> 03:43.390
Oh?

03:43.390 --> 03:48.290
Lady Atofe was enraged when
she found out about this.

03:48.550 --> 03:51.670
I see, I understand now.

03:59.800 --> 04:22.200
What shines in the cold, distant sky

04:22.200 --> 04:33.300
Why am I burning away?

04:33.300 --> 04:44.600
The human world is like a star, too

04:44.600 --> 04:55.020
Though its light is beautiful now

04:54.590 --> 04:55.820
Rudeus.

04:55.020 --> 05:06.830
Where will it go from here?

04:56.170 --> 04:58.590
We're going to take the Sokas Grass.

04:58.590 --> 05:00.320
Yes, please.

05:01.050 --> 05:05.930
If Lady Atofe gives you any reward,
I advise you to refuse it.

05:05.930 --> 05:06.830
Reward?

05:06.830 --> 05:18.170
What will be left behind when it's gone?

05:07.140 --> 05:12.830
If you end up accepting a reward from her,
we won't be able to help you.

05:13.500 --> 05:15.140
I'll keep that in mind.

05:34.740 --> 05:36.360
She is still not here?

05:36.620 --> 05:41.000
Royalty requires time to prepare
before receiving guests.

05:41.000 --> 05:43.990
Making us wait for two hours
is too much, isn't it?

05:43.990 --> 05:46.450
Where's Lady Atofe?

05:46.950 --> 05:48.330
They said someone is fetching her.

05:48.490 --> 05:50.909
To think that she went
outside of the city...

05:51.040 --> 05:52.370
You lot, be quiet!

05:52.540 --> 05:54.810
They were acting pretty casual.

05:54.810 --> 05:57.340
Hearing them put me at ease.

05:57.340 --> 05:58.300
Move.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.670
Y-yes.

05:59.670 --> 06:00.550
Good.

06:07.850 --> 06:09.760
I am Immortal Demon King

06:10.020 --> 06:12.560
Atoferatofe Rybak!

06:17.900 --> 06:19.190
Lady Atofe!

06:19.450 --> 06:23.950
I told you many times to enter
the throne room

06:24.360 --> 06:26.070
from the back door!

06:26.320 --> 06:27.820
Entering from the front door

06:27.990 --> 06:29.870
makes me feel good.

06:30.160 --> 06:31.620
Please, don't say that.

06:32.120 --> 06:34.580
Your father would be embarrassed!

06:34.960 --> 06:37.330
And also your husband, Lord Rybak...

06:37.920 --> 06:39.800
Shut up!

06:43.550 --> 06:46.260
Stop nagging me in front of the guests!

06:46.510 --> 06:47.640
I understand.

06:48.050 --> 06:51.220
But please be mindful of
your manner.

06:51.980 --> 06:54.140
I'm glad you get it.

06:54.850 --> 06:56.600
Now, let's do it again.

06:57.130 --> 06:58.060
As you command!

06:59.550 --> 07:01.110
I am Immortal Demon King

07:01.360 --> 07:03.650
Atoferatofe Rybak!

07:10.320 --> 07:11.910
First of all, allow me to thank you.

07:12.040 --> 07:13.370
Thanks to you all,

07:13.450 --> 07:15.500
we were able to catch that fool.

07:16.250 --> 07:19.330
We have no pictures of her
when she was a kid,

07:19.540 --> 07:22.460
so we couldn't make
progress with the search.

07:23.380 --> 07:26.590
You did well to find her for us.

07:27.010 --> 07:27.880
Also...

07:31.580 --> 07:33.810
I wonder if her battery ran out.

07:34.130 --> 07:36.440
Moore, what was next?

07:36.620 --> 07:37.980
A reward.

07:38.060 --> 07:38.900
That's right.

07:39.110 --> 07:40.690
I have to give you a reward.

07:40.940 --> 07:43.650
No, that's not necessary.

07:45.690 --> 07:48.240
Are you saying you don't want

07:48.240 --> 07:49.530
my reward?

07:53.330 --> 07:54.330
No.

07:54.790 --> 07:57.040
What is it you want to give us?

07:58.920 --> 08:00.960
I'll let you join my personal guard

08:01.170 --> 08:04.000
so I can train you without rest.

08:04.460 --> 08:05.550
It's a great honor, isn't it?

08:05.880 --> 08:08.090
W-Well...

08:11.550 --> 08:12.930
My apologies,

08:13.260 --> 08:15.140
but we have to refuse that honor.

08:15.470 --> 08:17.810
Don't be shy!

08:18.310 --> 08:21.230
I have a family waiting at home.

08:22.270 --> 08:24.480
No problem.

08:24.680 --> 08:27.650
I haven't seen my son once
in the last hundred years either.

08:28.070 --> 08:30.570
And I have a sick friend
waiting for me.

08:30.880 --> 08:33.159
I need to find a cure
as soon as possible

08:33.320 --> 08:34.780
and return to her.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.330
Besides...

08:37.620 --> 08:40.750
Shut up!

08:41.750 --> 08:44.090
Are you going to be my guard or not?

08:44.420 --> 08:45.670
Make your choice!

08:46.000 --> 08:47.340
N-No!

08:47.550 --> 08:48.970
Why?!

08:49.110 --> 08:50.930
Why are you refusing me?

08:50.930 --> 08:52.260
Uh...

08:52.850 --> 08:56.180
Right, he doesn't understand
the Demon God language.

08:56.180 --> 08:57.770
I can't rely on him.

08:57.980 --> 09:00.310
She is an idiot.

09:00.700 --> 09:03.100
You won't be able to hold
a conversation with her.

09:03.690 --> 09:04.770
Shut up!

09:04.900 --> 09:07.400
I'm not an idiot!

09:07.570 --> 09:09.740
You're going to be my guard!

09:07.650 --> 09:08.940
Oh no!

09:09.150 --> 09:10.360
Everyone, let's hold her!

09:09.990 --> 09:10.610
Aren't you happy?

09:10.700 --> 09:11.360
Lady Atofe!

09:11.030 --> 09:11.990
Aren't you honored?

09:11.860 --> 09:13.410
Please calm down!

09:13.570 --> 09:15.450
Move it! Move it!

09:15.630 --> 09:16.700
Move it!

09:17.160 --> 09:18.500
You guys, get out of my way!

09:17.490 --> 09:19.830
Master, leave this to me!

09:18.740 --> 09:19.660
Move it!

09:23.880 --> 09:25.920
You're pretty strong!

09:25.920 --> 09:27.620
Calm yourself!

09:27.620 --> 09:30.440
We aren't here to offend you!

09:30.440 --> 09:31.300
We only want the grass!

09:31.380 --> 09:34.970
Don't speak with words
that I can't understand!

09:36.600 --> 09:37.350
Hey you...

09:38.140 --> 09:39.270
You're hard like a rock.

09:39.470 --> 09:42.060
You got some Battle Aura there!

09:42.210 --> 09:43.480
Interesting!

09:47.190 --> 09:48.050
Fine.

09:48.470 --> 09:52.030
I, the Immortal Demon King,
Atoferatofe Rybak!

09:52.470 --> 09:55.200
The wife of Kalman Rybak,

09:55.700 --> 09:58.950
the founder of the North God Style,

09:59.790 --> 10:05.540
will show you the true North God Style!

10:09.590 --> 10:10.590
Die!

10:10.760 --> 10:14.010
This is North God Style's ultimate...

10:20.890 --> 10:22.180
Lady Atofe!

10:21.330 --> 10:23.150
Ah, this is bad.

10:22.390 --> 10:24.020
She's falling outside!

10:23.150 --> 10:26.980
I was focused on protecting you,
so I forgot to hold myself back.

10:24.100 --> 10:27.270
Ah, now they've really done it.

10:27.180 --> 10:29.040
I wonder if she's dead.

10:27.740 --> 10:28.860
Can you see her?

10:28.980 --> 10:31.030
No, she's too far.

10:29.040 --> 10:31.820
No, I'm sure she's still alive.

10:36.620 --> 10:41.220
Are you sure you two
don't want to join us?

10:41.220 --> 10:42.950
W-We don't want to.

10:44.320 --> 10:46.330
Then, run away.

10:46.940 --> 10:49.510
There's an escape tunnel
below the castle.

10:49.510 --> 10:50.840
Are you sure?

10:51.180 --> 10:53.370
In the past 5000 years,

10:53.370 --> 11:00.660
no one other than North God Kalman and
Demon God Laplace has beaten our king.

11:00.660 --> 11:03.350
S-She's that strong, huh?

11:03.350 --> 11:07.350
If you lose to her,
you'll be forced to sign a contract.

11:07.350 --> 11:10.370
Most of us are here
because we want to be,

11:10.370 --> 11:12.480
but there are also those who
don't want to be here.

11:12.820 --> 11:15.000
Please don't end up like me.

11:15.000 --> 11:16.570
I want to see my family.

11:18.080 --> 11:21.010
Then, I will accept that advice.

11:21.010 --> 11:22.040
Sob!

11:26.460 --> 11:28.830
Is it okay to take
Lady Kishirika with us?

11:31.760 --> 11:36.750
Well, our mission was only to
catch and bring her here.

11:38.840 --> 11:41.840
Thank you.
You have my gratitude.

11:42.660 --> 11:44.910
Senior Cliff! Elinalise!

11:44.910 --> 11:45.900
Rudeus?

11:45.900 --> 11:47.850
What's wrong?
Why are you in a hurry?

11:47.850 --> 11:49.890
I'll explain while we move.

11:49.890 --> 11:51.230
More importantly,
got the Sokas Grass?

11:51.520 --> 11:52.810
Don't worry.

11:52.810 --> 11:54.740
They also taught us
how to cultivate it.

11:56.260 --> 11:59.140
Nice!
Let's escape through the tunnel!

11:59.140 --> 12:01.440
No, don't go there.

12:01.440 --> 12:05.370
Badi destroyed that tunnel in the past.
I'm sure nothing has changed there.

12:05.370 --> 12:06.790
Seriously?

12:06.790 --> 12:10.110
Moore is a cunning rascal.

12:10.110 --> 12:14.170
He said all those things to you,
but I'm sure he's plotting something.

12:14.930 --> 12:17.610
She won't tell us a lie
in this condition.

12:17.610 --> 12:20.550
Okay, then.
Let's escape from the first floor...

12:20.550 --> 12:22.690
Moore!

12:23.560 --> 12:26.320
Chase them!

12:26.320 --> 12:27.460
That's scary!

12:31.770 --> 12:33.750
Where are you going?

12:33.750 --> 12:37.110
There's a teleportation circle that
we used to go here in this direction.

12:37.110 --> 12:40.900
Oh? Such a thing still
remains out here?

12:40.900 --> 12:42.780
But then again...

12:43.180 --> 12:45.430
Why are you stopping so suddenly?!

12:46.700 --> 12:49.290
You are late.

12:49.540 --> 12:51.420
Wow...

12:51.580 --> 12:53.960
You're quite fast, aren't you?

12:58.300 --> 13:00.680
It didn't take long to fly here.

13:01.340 --> 13:04.850
I could see you running away
back there.

13:05.470 --> 13:07.350
Well done, Moore.

13:07.560 --> 13:10.180
It was just as you said.

13:10.540 --> 13:12.480
Then, I hope you'll do as

13:12.480 --> 13:13.900
I asked you next time.

13:13.980 --> 13:15.110
I refuse!

13:22.990 --> 13:24.570
I am Immortal Demon King

13:24.740 --> 13:26.740
Atoferatofe Rybak!

13:27.200 --> 13:29.700
If you defeat me,
I will declare you a hero!

13:30.120 --> 13:32.870
If you lose, I will use you
as my puppet until you die.

13:33.380 --> 13:36.920
Moore, all of you, don't interfere.

13:37.840 --> 13:40.800
I won't let my guard down this time.

13:41.260 --> 13:43.300
I'm a quick learner.

13:43.680 --> 13:45.600
Use that again.

13:48.320 --> 13:51.900
Sorry, Sylphie, I might not be able
to make it back home.

13:51.900 --> 13:53.270
Rudeus.

13:53.270 --> 13:56.940
Let's have Cliff escape to
the teleportation circle.

13:56.940 --> 14:01.070
If we send him with the grass,
it should be able to save Nanahoshi.

14:01.070 --> 14:04.860
Moreover, he can call for
reinforcements.

14:04.860 --> 14:06.240
I get it.

14:06.240 --> 14:08.190
Can you convince him?

14:08.190 --> 14:09.620
I'll try.

14:10.090 --> 14:13.020
If we can get Cliff to escape,
Nanahoshi can be saved.

14:13.020 --> 14:16.060
I want to save her.
That's my purpose.

14:16.060 --> 14:18.250
But I also want to return home.

14:18.460 --> 14:20.280
Don't be afraid.

14:20.690 --> 14:24.760
Even at the cost of my life,
I will hold Demon King Atofe back.

14:28.140 --> 14:29.170
I understand.

14:29.630 --> 14:31.060
Rudeus.

14:34.820 --> 14:37.680
You will lead the attack.

14:37.680 --> 14:40.830
Zanoba and I will take care of Atofe.

14:40.830 --> 14:44.730
Then, you will take care of
the guys behind us.

14:44.730 --> 14:46.070
Understood.

14:46.240 --> 14:49.950
Are you dreaming of beating me?

14:55.710 --> 14:58.480
It doesn't work!
I have to use Electric after all?

14:58.480 --> 14:59.790
Master.

14:59.790 --> 15:02.010
Please have faith in me.

15:05.180 --> 15:06.640
Here I go!

15:13.270 --> 15:14.730
I can see through it!

15:15.140 --> 15:19.440
Wait! I tell you to wait!

15:19.560 --> 15:20.150
I can see...

15:21.900 --> 15:23.230
Stink!

15:23.480 --> 15:26.990
How dare you throw her at me!

15:33.870 --> 15:34.830
Weak!

15:41.170 --> 15:41.840
Not yet!

15:51.510 --> 15:52.720
Come!

15:55.890 --> 15:57.690
You bastard dare to hug me?!

15:57.810 --> 15:59.100
Don't you have any shame?!

16:04.160 --> 16:05.530
Master!

16:05.530 --> 16:06.660
Senior Cliff!

16:07.280 --> 16:08.610
You all!

16:08.820 --> 16:11.530
Don't let even one of them escape!

16:11.620 --> 16:13.410
L-Let's chase them!

16:13.240 --> 16:13.870
Y-Yes, sir!

16:14.320 --> 16:15.650
Too late for that!

16:16.410 --> 16:17.460
What?!

16:21.920 --> 16:26.130
Fire Spirit who presides over
all things between heaven and earth.

16:26.420 --> 16:29.760
Raging flames, consume my body.

16:30.340 --> 16:32.190
Burning Place!

16:36.060 --> 16:38.520
Everyone, use Burning Place!

16:38.810 --> 16:39.600
Yes, sir!

16:41.680 --> 16:43.110
Moore!

16:43.380 --> 16:45.190
Don't let him run away!

16:45.320 --> 16:45.980
Yes, ma'am!

16:46.070 --> 16:47.440
I won't let you!

16:47.740 --> 16:49.850
Rudeus, stop him!

16:49.850 --> 16:51.070
Y-Yes!

16:54.870 --> 16:57.790
Unknown God!

16:58.000 --> 17:01.460
Answer my call and raise the earth
up toward the heavens!

17:01.610 --> 17:04.520
Earth Lance!

17:10.470 --> 17:12.839
Spirits of the barren lands!

17:13.800 --> 17:16.680
Answer my call and deliver unto...

17:17.359 --> 17:19.020
Disturb Magic!

17:19.140 --> 17:19.810
Impossible!

17:20.140 --> 17:21.560
Disturb Magic?!

17:22.140 --> 17:24.810
Bestow upon me thy power,
Water Spirits.

17:25.940 --> 17:27.609
Deep Mist!

17:32.200 --> 17:32.990
Release me!

17:33.200 --> 17:33.950
Let's trade fists!

17:34.030 --> 17:35.350
He can't be stopped.

17:35.350 --> 17:37.910
So this is the strength of
a veteran mage.

17:37.910 --> 17:39.660
Rudeus, help Cliff!

17:39.970 --> 17:41.830
Moore!

17:41.920 --> 17:43.710
As you command, Lady Atofe!

18:12.550 --> 18:14.660
What happened to Cliff?

18:17.550 --> 18:18.410
Moore?

18:19.030 --> 18:21.120
He's still able to cast magic?

18:21.120 --> 18:22.910
I need to use Disturb Magic.

18:22.910 --> 18:24.830
Wind Bind!

18:25.580 --> 18:28.270
Hand, absorb!

18:29.670 --> 18:30.590
What?!

18:31.050 --> 18:32.510
Take that, you geezer.

18:32.760 --> 18:35.800
Now you've done it.

18:36.640 --> 18:39.260
And you use some weird magic.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.390
Still,

18:40.890 --> 18:44.270
I'm looking forward to seeing you
as my subordinate.

18:45.020 --> 18:48.250
Senior Cliff, please...

18:48.760 --> 18:52.740
I trust you to persuade Perugius.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.820
Cliff!

18:56.560 --> 18:59.120
No way. There's another one
inside there?!

19:01.580 --> 19:03.620
Lady Atofe...

19:03.830 --> 19:06.370
This teleportation circle leads to...

19:06.750 --> 19:07.500
Peru...

19:13.370 --> 19:16.630
Perugius!

19:16.630 --> 19:19.030
I never thought to have you here.

19:19.490 --> 19:24.100
Your filthy soldiers have sullied
my fortress with their blood.

19:24.100 --> 19:25.650
I see.

19:25.650 --> 19:29.360
Atofe ordered her subordinates
to investigate the teleportation circle.

19:29.980 --> 19:31.190
You're in the way!

19:37.490 --> 19:40.520
Did you let your guard down again?

19:40.520 --> 19:43.950
That does seem to be your speciality,
Immortal Demon King.

19:44.040 --> 19:47.790
I see. You send them to kill me...

19:48.380 --> 19:51.590
What happened to the oath
you made to Kal?!

19:52.050 --> 19:56.940
I'll keep my promise to Kal,
since he was my best friend.

19:58.610 --> 20:01.470
This dragon lives only to serve.

20:02.100 --> 20:06.730
His claws are so long and sharp,
he can never clench his hand.

20:04.850 --> 20:06.730
You, don't tell me...

20:07.020 --> 20:10.740
When rage consumes him,
he cannot close his fist.

20:10.740 --> 20:14.610
Although his claws may break and his
fangs fall out, you shall soon realize

20:14.610 --> 20:19.700
what emotion consumes this faithful
dragon as he abandons his devotion.

20:18.200 --> 20:19.990
Lady Atofe!

20:20.020 --> 20:22.300
O dragon general,
thou who was the third to die,

20:22.300 --> 20:26.700
whose eyes were the sharpest,
whose body was covered in white scales.

20:27.090 --> 20:30.580
I, Armored Dragon King Perugius,
summon thee!

20:31.670 --> 20:33.630
Open, Front Wyrmgate!

20:33.630 --> 20:35.670
Beckon forth, Rear Wyrmgate!

20:38.280 --> 20:40.720
Perugi...

20:40.720 --> 20:43.470
Are you going to break your oath?!

20:43.970 --> 20:45.240
I won't break my oath.

20:45.680 --> 20:51.190
However, this is a rare opportunity
that I can't afford to pass up.

20:52.880 --> 20:54.270
Armored Dragon Strike,

20:54.860 --> 20:56.360
First Slash.

20:58.440 --> 21:00.110
I won't forget this!

21:02.510 --> 21:05.750
Perugius!

21:08.790 --> 21:11.580
Lady Atofe!

21:12.530 --> 21:15.000
That won't kill you, anyway.

21:15.000 --> 21:19.220
Sylvaril, pick up those four
and tend to their wounds.

21:19.660 --> 21:22.840
I see the Great Emperor of
the Demon World, Kishirika, too.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.690
Leave her alone.

21:25.690 --> 21:26.480
As you command.

21:28.030 --> 21:29.530
We're saved.

21:33.760 --> 21:37.820
Thanks to two of them, we can hold
the Immortal Demon King off.

21:38.230 --> 21:40.670
Our friendship may be priceless,

21:40.670 --> 21:43.380
but I have to give them my appreciation
when we return home.

21:43.380 --> 21:46.330
That will do!
Well then, goodbye!

21:50.220 --> 21:52.570
What a run by Cliff.

21:53.130 --> 21:55.080
We've acquired the Sokas Grass.

21:57.290 --> 22:00.150
Now, we will be able to
cure Nanahoshi.

22:01.840 --> 22:05.010
(Episode 10)
(An Audience with the Immortal Demon King)

22:19.610 --> 22:28.740
Love is like a bubble that
will burst when touched

22:28.740 --> 22:37.580
Like a morning that will be forgotten
if you stay curled up

22:37.580 --> 22:45.470
I dedicate these days to you,
so I can keep thinking of you forever

22:45.880 --> 22:54.850
My words, my heart, even the red blood
flowing through me, all of it

22:54.850 --> 23:03.940
I love you so much,
even in places God could never reach

23:03.940 --> 23:13.120
Look, my pulse is beating right to
the very tips of our intertwined fingers

23:13.120 --> 23:21.300
May your tears roll down
your smiling cheeks

23:21.300 --> 23:27.760
I'll fall asleep
when the prayers are over

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
(Next Episode)
(Turning Point 4)
